Army dust and noise fill sky --- Frightened herds flee in all directions --- Rāma bids Lakṣmaṇa discern the tumult --- Lakṣmaṇa climbs flowering śāla eastward --- Lakṣmaṇa sees chariot elephant infantry host --- Lakṣmaṇa warns Sītā to cave and string bow --- Lakṣmaṇa accuses consecrated Bharata of murder intent --- Lakṣmaṇa spots Kōvidāra banner on chariot --- Lakṣmaṇa vows to kill Bharata and Kaikēyī --- Lakṣmaṇa promises blood drenched Citrakūṭa forest
